\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 85 Predigten. Proprium de tempore vom 1. Adventssonntag bis Passionssonntag.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 146e\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  41 Predigten bis Quinquagesima. Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quia deus gloriosus sublimis et supremus rerum artifex ... ex primis parentibus illatam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica prima in aduentu domini secundum Matheum. In illo tempore ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum appropinquasset ... Istud ewangelium scribitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Mt. 21 ca\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (21, 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et legitur bis in anno ... Antequam ergo perueniamus ad declaracionem textus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  incarnatus est in nomine domini id est dei patris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Feria quarta in aduentu ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In illo tempore venit Johannes baptista ... Istud ewangelium scribitur Mt. 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   ca\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 lo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (3, 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et legitur feria quarta post dominicam primam aduentus. Et in isto ewangelio ewangelista ostendit Christum esse verum deum ...\endash ... in nomine eius qui venturus est et sic patat sentencia tocius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . ... (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In dominica L\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In illo tempore assumpsit Jhesus duodecim discipulos ... Hoc ewangelium scribitur Luce 18\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 uo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   ca\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 lo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (18, 31)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et legitur in dominica quinquagesima propter quinquaginta dies \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  duo ceci commemorati a Matheo. Et tantum de illo ewangelio etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 146e\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Tituli. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt tytuli questionum huius prime partis lecture ewangeliorum de tempore ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 334\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 43 Fastenpredigten. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ewangelium quod legitur in capite ieiunii scilicet feria quarta in die cinerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In illo tempore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum ieiuniatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hoc ewangelium scribitur Mt. quinto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (korrigiert in: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  VI.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) (6, 16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et legitur feria quarta que dicitur caput ieiunii vel dies cinerum. Pro quo sciendum quod illa feria quarta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  tamquam ignobiliori adhibeat studio philosophie tamquam nobiliori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . ... (321\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In die cene ewangelium secundum Johannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In illo tempore ante diem festum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hoc ewangelium scribitur Joh. XIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (13, 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et legitur feria quinta post dominicam palmarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   signa discrecionis et deuocionis appareant. Et hec de sacra communione dicta sufficiant etc. Amen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  1445\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; \endash  335\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 337\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 410\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Passionspredigt in 20 Teilen. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Engelschal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Passio domini nostri Jhesu Christi secundum Matheum XXVI, Marcum XIIII, Lucam XXII et Johannem XVIIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In illo tempore ... Scitis quia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (26, 1\endash 25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quia nullus ewangelistarum materiam huius dominice passionis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (403\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Altera autem die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 27, 62) ... (403\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  XX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec est vicesima et vltima pars principalis huius passionis ...\endash ... propter innocentem mortem Christi. Et sic finis est huius. Deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Anno XLV tempore paschali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; (411\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 417\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Tituli. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt tituli lecture quadragesimalis et primo tituli questionum primi ewangelii scilicet in capite ieiunii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (417\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finitum per me Nicolaum Goldner. Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  XLV\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in die s. Braxedis virginis hora meridiei uel quasi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  418\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 419\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
