\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Subskription: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit Sensatus per quadragesimam comparatus per Georium Hertt protunc socius diuinorum in Brixna cui dominus sit propicius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Zusatz (Handwechsel): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Secundum alios iste liber intitulatur Esculaus per quadragesimam.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (308\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 314\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Anhang: Sermones de tempore, 1.\endash 4. Tag in der Woche nach Ostern.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (308\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 310\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) [D]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vo ex discipulis Jhesu ibant ipsa die in castellum nomine Emaus Luce 24 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Consueuerunt boni magistri et doctores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   eum cognoscemus. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (310\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Feria secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Randeintrag): [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  urrexit dominus ... Luce 24 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (34). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quia testes debent esse certi de hiis qui testificati sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quem ipse pastorum princeps omnium singulariter honorauit etc. Rogemus etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 313\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Feria tercia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Randeintrag): [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  tetit Jhesus in medio ... Luce vltimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (24, 36). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum rex a sua curia uel pontifex a sua ecclesia uel paterfamilias a sua familia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ut discam mandata tua etc. Rogemus etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (313\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 314\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Feria quarta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Randeintrag): [O]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  portebat pati Christum ... Luce vltimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (24, 46). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sicut dicit philosophus opposita iuxta se posita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sanctissime caritatis cui est honor et gloria per infinita seculorum secula amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  315\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 318\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
