\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dicemus quod res medicacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Avicenna, Canon medicinae I, 4, 1\endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Thorndike/Kibre \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  414). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In precedentibus vt prima et secunda fen {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Avicenna determinauit de pertinentibus ad partem theoricam medicine}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in tercia eciam determinauit de pertinentibus ad partem practicam conseruatam. In presenti determinat de hiis que pertinent ad partem curatiuam in vniuersali merito inchoauit a conseruacione ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Cap. 20 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Flebotomia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  mit griechischer Randglosse; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \endash ... Sit quantitas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Avicenna, Canon medicinae I, 4, 31)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Nunc A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [vicenna] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  finem dictis imponit ad sequencia transiturus superne potencie referendo grates dicit quod hec sit sufficiens quantitatis determinacionis de presentibus vniuersalibus medicine. Deinde ualde laboramus in faciendo librum de simplicibus medicinis deo uolente ... illum ergo inuocemus ... qui liberat liquidum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.}

