\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Titel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Prima pars secundi de vniuerso Gwilhelmi Parisiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 1a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer; (1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Prima pars. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit secundi libri de vniuerso pars prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Honoret te deus quoniam et te ipsum non parum acceptabiliter honoras}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quare vniuersi spiritualis secundum antiquos tres partes sint\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Scito igitur inprimis quia vniuersum spirituale cuius hic tractatum incipio, in tres partes diuiditur secundum opinionem antiquorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  similiter et in vltimitate speciositatis. Et sic est finis prime partis secundi libri de vniuerso magistri Wilhelmi Parisiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Secunda pars. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Stabili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [sa]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  cio secunde partis vniuersi est pars eiusdem spiritualis continens substancias spirituales abstractas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hiis igitur determinatis reuertar ad  stabiliendam partem secundam vniuersi que est pars eius spiritualis hanc omnino negauit secta quedam gentis Hebreorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  omnia consistoria quaerimoniis et litigiis iudiciisque earum perstrepunt.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 Hain/Copinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18  8319. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18  Guilelmus  Alvernus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 ... opera omnia, Venetiis 1591. \endash  Vgl. BSB-Ink G-473 (Enth\u228 \'e4lt nur Lib. I: De universo corporali). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire I Nr. 141 w (Hs. genannt). \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18  Ders.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18  Facult\u233 \'e9 Nr. 148 w (Hs. genannt).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   }

