\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Sammlung von 181 Predigten; f\u252 \'fcr die Vorfastenzeit von Purificatio bis Aschermittwoch, die Fastenzeit bis Ostern und die Zeit von Resurrectio bis Ascensio domini.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Purificatio bis Aschermittwoch: (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) In purificatione beatae Mariae. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [M]aria et Yoseph et Symeon et Anna ho[dierno] die venerabilem processionem cum Christo fecerunt }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quando eum in templo presentabant ut sisterent eum domino Luce II\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (2).\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et cum inducerent puerum Jhesum parentes eius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Lc 2, 27)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... In quo et nos instruimur ad gracias agendum deo de omnibus beneficiis nostris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedixit inquam deum. Interlineariter: Viso redemptore gracias reddidit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   de implecione promissionis de exhibicione saluatoris gloza ordinaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  fugiamus ergo vanitates illas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  [C]ircumdederunt me gemitus mortis et sumptum est hoc verbum  ex psalmo (CAO 1811). Sancta mater ecclesia heri in vesperis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   cantica leticie et exultacionis organa suspendit et vocem lamentacionis et penitencie assumpsit ...\endash ... eo modo loquendi quomodo ymago Herculem Hercules vorat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . ... Folgen 175 Predigten. \endash  187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  [Q]uis vestrum habebit amicum etc. (Lc 11, 5). Sancta mater ecclesia contra pestes morborum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   que solent accidere paschali tempore propter exvberanciam viciorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  obsecraciones postulaciones oraciones gloriarum pro omnibus hominibus pro regibus qui in etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) In ascensione domini: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Duxit eos foras in Bethaniam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et eleuatis manibus benedixit illum et factum est etc. Luc. vltimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (24, 50). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Circa dominicam ascensionis IIII determinantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  primum est vnde ascendit ...\endash ... ut suum ostium aperirent dicentes: Tollite portas principes vestras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) In ascensione domini:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  [D]ominus quidem Jhesus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   postquam locutus est eis adsumptus est in celum et sedit a dextris dei Marci vltimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (16,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ostendit in hiis uerbis de dominica ascensione vbi dicamus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  testatur ipse Matheo vltimo: Data est mihi omnis potestas in celo et in terra etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Contenta huius voluminis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.}

