\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt exce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [r]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  pta de erroribus Judeorum in Thalomut quos transtulit frate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [r]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Theobaldus superioris ordinis predicatorum ville Parysiensis sicut scribunt in sequentibus et patebunt etc. Sequitur prohemium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Thalmut id est doctrina Judeorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  submerserat duodecim exploratores et sic de aliis. Expliciunt dicta Thalamuth valde irracionabilia.
