\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt cautele famosissimi viri domini Bartolomei de Cepolla de Verona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  1. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nota singulariter quod si filius commisit aliquod delictum }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  siue crimen puta lese maiestatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  317 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (325)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Si quis mandat aliquem occidi ... nec ulterius consulens uel persuadens\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (bricht ab). 
