\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Corpus operum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ps.-Dionysii Areopagitae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22    translatione {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannis Scoti Eriugenae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  De coelesti hierarchia. Proemium: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hanc libam sacro Grecorum nectare fartam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gloriosissimo catholicorum regum Karolo Iohannes extremus sophie studentium salvtem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < ... (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt libri sancti Dionisii Ariopagite, quos Iohannes Iervgena transtulit de greco in latinum iubente ac postulante rege Karolo Lvdovici imperatoris filio. Incipiunt capitvla libri primi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < Capitula; (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Liber sancti Dionisii Ariopagite episcopi Athenarum ad Timotheum episcopum Ephesiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit liber primus...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  De ecclesiastica hierarchia; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  De divinis nominibus; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  De mystica theologia; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  Epistulae.  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Schreibersubskription: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  En ego tantillus Otloh uulgo vocitatus ...\endash ... Vos quoque qui legitis ueniam mihi posco petatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Bischoff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Ma. St. II S. 89. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: PL 122, 1029A\endash 1070C; 1069D\endash 1112B; 1111C\endash 1172B; 1171B\endash 1176C; 1171B\endash 1176C; 1176C\endash 1194C. Hs. dient als Haupttextzeuge in PL 122, vgl. Prooemium XIII \u167 \'a7 13. Interlinear- und Marginalglossen sind in den Lesartenapparat aufgenommen. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 P. Lehmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Zur Kenntnis der Schriften des Dionysius Areopagita im Mittelalter (Erforschung des Mittelalters IV) Stuttgart 1961 S. 128\endash 141 (Hs. genannt S. 138); Erstver\u246 \'f6ff.: Revue b\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9dictine 35 (1923) S. 81\endash 97. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 Bischoff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Ma. St. II S. 135 Anm. 116 (Der Text De coelesti hierarchia wirkt nicht weiter in Clm 14070 b). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 B. Faes de Mottoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Corpus Dionysianum nel medioevo., Rassegna di studi 1900\endash 1972 (Consiglio nazionale delle ricerche del centro di studio per la storia della storiografia filosofica) Bologna 1977 S. 35 ff. \endash  Zur Geschichtsdarstellung Othlos: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 R. Budde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Die rechtliche Stellung des Klosters St. Emmeram in Regensburg, in: Archiv f\u252 \'fcr Urkundenforschung 5 (1914) S. 180 ff. (Hs. genannt S. 181, 192). }

