\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  1a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Inhaltsverzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In hoc uolumine continentur magistri Petri Abelardi libri duo de diuersis diuine pagine sententiis. Item domini Hugonis liber unus de questionibus uariis. Liber domini Hugonis de claustralibus partium trium.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   B\u252 \'fccherfluch:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Qui me furetur sibi perpes pena paretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  1a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Petrus Abaelardus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sententiae (Sententiae Hermanni)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Accessus:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Petrus qui Abelardus a plerisque Baiolardus dicitur natione Anglicus primum grammatice et dialetice hinc diuinitati operam dedit ... hodie plura uideamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Capitula; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt sentencie magistri Petri Abelardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tria sunt vt arbitror in quibus humane salutis summa consistit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... inde grauiter est puniendus.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: PL 178, 1695\endash 1758 (Petrus Abaelardus). \endash  Edition: Sententie magistri Petri Abelardi \endash  Sententie Hermanni \endash , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 S. Buzzetti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Pubblicazioni della facolt\u224 \'e0 di lettere e filosofia dell'universit\u224 \'e0 di Milano 31) Florenz 1983 S. 25\endash 163 (diese Hs. mit Sigle M', S. 7). \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , RS 644 (Hermannus zugeschrieben. Hs. genannt). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Pour revaloriser Migne S. 70.  \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 J. Barrow, C. S. F.  Burnett, D. E. Luscombe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , A checklist of the manuscripts containing the writings of Peter Abelard and Helo\u239 \'efse and other works closely associated with Abelard and his school, in: Revue d'histoire des textes 14/15 S. 205 Nr. 84.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

