\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash XIV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 368\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Albertus Engelschalk de Straubing}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones super epistulas dominicales per annum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash XIV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    Notabilia epistularum. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt notabilia lecture epistularum per circulum anni et primo epistule prime scientes quia hora est iam nos de sompno surgere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De multiplici exposicione litterali huius epistule secundum diuersos doctores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Prolog: (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Circumfulsit eum lux de celo. Scribuntur hec verba Actuum IX (9,3). Digni ac dilecti discipuli quamquam singuli sancti }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deinde earundem epistularum sentencias  cum notabilibus subiungam. In nomine benedicti et indiuidue trinitatis patris et filii et spiritus sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Fratres, scientes quia {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 hora est... Hec leccio scribitur in epistula ad Romanos XIIIo (13, 11). Et legitur in prima dominica aduentus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   domini in qua apostolus nobis comendat caritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De emulacione autem et iuidia in sequentibus dicetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Fratres, quecumque scripta sunt vt per pacienciam in spe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec leccio scribitur epistula ad Romanos XV capitulo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (15, 4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et legitur dominica secunda in aduentu in qua apostolus ostendit quod auctoritas pertinet ad instruccionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  desperacio est vicium multum detestabile et mortale etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; Etc.; (354\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Itaque fratres mei karissimi et desiderantissimi gaudium meum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [H]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ec leccio sicribitur ad Philippenses  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (4, 1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et legitur dominica XXIIII post festum trinitatis, In hac ergo epistula Paulus apostolus ex habundancia cordis loquitur ...\endash ... dignus erit corona magister\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (359\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) [Fra]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  tres, non cessamus pro vobis orantes ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [H]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ec leccio scribitur ad Colonicenses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) (Col 1, 9) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  dominica XXV post festum sancte trinitatis pro cuius introduccione sciendum quod \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nam quis alius est finis noster nisi peruenire ad regnum cuius nullus est finis. Quod nobis concedere dignetur dominus noster Ihesus Christus in secula seculorum benedictus amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (368\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finitus est liber iste per me Hainricum Haslaher de Ratispona in vigilia apostolorum Petri et Pauli anno etc. XLIIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  368\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
