\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) leer bis auf getilgten Eintrag und Titel:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Liber Rabani de officiis et obseruationibus ecclesiasticis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Prolog; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Capitula librorum; (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Expliciunt capitula libri tertii. Prohemium ad fratres Fuldensis monasterii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit liber primus Hrabani Mauri de institutione clericorum. De una dei aecclesia catholica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finit liber Rabani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
