\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Liber tercius de vi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [ta]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et ho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [nestate] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  clericorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Incipiunt reportata tercii libri decretalium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   de uita et honestate clericorum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Expliciunt sollempnia dicta super tercium librum decretalium domini Johannis de Lingnano utriusque iuris excellentissimi doctoris etc. Structure uestes conuiuia sunt quasi pestes. Hec tria gaudentes faciunt miseros et egentes.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  327\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 328\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
