\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes de Capestrano}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De cupiditate}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit tractatus fratris Johannis de Capistrano de cupiditatibus. Incipiunt capitula in tractatum de vsuris et primo quedam antecedencia eiusdem tractatus et prime partis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nolite thesaurizare vobis thesauros in terra Mt. VI}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  (19). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Vt discuciamus thesaurizacionis materiam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... pacientur turbinem scilicet penalitatem etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit tercia pars secunde partis de cupiditate secundum fratrem Johannem de Capistrano. Hic tractatus est comparatus per venerabilem virum magistrum Hermannum P\u246 \'f6tzlinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: Johannes von Capistrano, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 E. Jacob\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , T. 2, 2, Breslau 1907, S. 42\endash 370. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , GQ II, 447. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 J. Hofer,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Johannes Kapistran, Ein Leben im Kampf um die Reform der Kirche (Bibliotheca franciscana 1 u. 2) Rom, Heidelberg 1964, 1965, Bd. 1, S. 209; Bd. 2, S. 295 u. \u246 \'f6. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  VL IV, 561 ff.}

