\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Vom 1. Sonntag im Advent  bis 24. Sonntag nach Pfingsten. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Primus sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Veni domine Jesu (Apc 22,20). Licet circa solas dominicales }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  epistulas et evangelia velim hic negociari ...\endash ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   qui testimonium perhibunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  istorum et dixit etc. venio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Apc 22,20)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur: et hoc est nomen quo vocabunt eum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ier 23,6)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Hoc est tertium membrum huius epistule ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et hoc uero est terribile impiis sed consolatorium iustis. Psalmo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (110,9)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   sanctum et terribile nomen eius. Rogemus. Iste sermo valet in circumcisione domini etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
