\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Von Andreas (30. November) bis Katharina (25. November). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  >De sancto Andrea apostolo< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Simili pena dominus (!) seruus cum domino est afflictus. Sapienciae XVIII (11).  Filius dei condolens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   generi humano vexillum sancte crucis in medio mundi constituit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ut similaretur sibi in gloria. Accipe hoc exemplum a sancto Andrea ... ut ad regnum celorum peruenias. Rogemus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (306\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ingressa est regina Saba ad regem Salomonem cum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   comitatu multo ... Regum XIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (III Rg 10, 1\endash 2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Legitur quod rex Salomon ita diues fuit quod temporibus suis ...\endash ... ut quicumque memoriam mee passionis habuerit saluus fiat. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Von anderer Hand)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et laus deo semper. Explicit Peregrinus de sanctis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  308\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Repertorium IV S. 564\endash 572 Nr. 195\endash 307 (ohne diese Hs.). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 G. de Martel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , w. o.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
