\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Ziertitelseite: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In Christi nomine in hoc corpore continentur epistolae Pavli apostoli numero quattvor decimae: Ad Romanos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (Oberer Rand, Nachtrag, 13. Jh.) Titel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Totum corpus epistolarum s. Pauli apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Unterer Rand, Nachtrag, 11. Jh.) Alleluia und Antiphon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ne reminiscaris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (De Tobia) mit Neumen \endash  vgl. CAO 3861;  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Bendedictio contra febres. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In nomine domini Jhesu Christi. In Ephasa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ciuitate in monte Celio ibi requiescunt VII dormientes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  libera nos a malo amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 A. Franz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Kirchliche Benediktionen im Mittelalter II, Graz 1960 S. 480 f. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Rm cum glossis: Prolog 660 \endash  Ziffern vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , RB; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Actus apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Commentarius anon. in Act:\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  11564; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Iac: 807; Apc: 829; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In nomine domini nostri Jhesu Christi incipit prologus sancti Hieronimi presbiteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < Prol.: 670 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit prologus sancti Hieronymi incipit versus sancti Damasi episcopi urbis Rome\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   654; (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Expliciunt versus sancti Damasi episcopi. Incipit argumentum epistole ad Romanos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < 674 (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit argumentum ad Romanos. Incipiunt capitula epistole eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Expliciunt tituli ad Romanos. Incipit argumentum aepistolae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!)< 651; (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit. Incipit argumentum eiusdem epistolae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < 677; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit argumentum. Incipit textus eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\pl