 783; (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Hbr: (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 793; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit argumentum. Incipit breues\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!)<; (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Expliciunt tituli ad Hebreos. Incipit epistola ad Hebreos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit epistola Pauli apostol\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  glo \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (bricht ab). \endash  Umstellung: Col nach Th.  
