\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  44 durchnumerierte Predigten: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ambulans Jesus iuxta mare Galilee (Mt 4, 18). Humanus defectus hominum est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   qui pena est peccati a primis parentibus commissi ...\endash ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sed homines ad celestem relinquerunt vnum patrem ut spirituales omnes fierent.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Respiciens autem Ihesus uidit eos qui mittebant etc. Luce 21\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Karissimi omnes et sepius experimur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  debet esse in proposito castitatis fixa: I Cor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (7, 8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dico autem non nuptis et uiduis bonum est illis manere.
