\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit opus magistri Hugonis et propositi sancte Victoris in Ierarchias sancti Dionysii Areopagite. De differencia mundane theologie atque diuine et demonstracionibus earundem.  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit tractatus Hugonis super Ierarchiam beatissimi patris et patroni Dyonisii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Summaria librorum Dionysii De divinis nominibus et De mystica theologia. \endash   66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
