\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Accedite eum et illuminaminis et facies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (Ps 33,6).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Ista sunt verba psalmiste psalmo trecesimo tercio sermonem suum ad nos dirigentis et incitantis nos ad eum dicens accedite etc. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Veni redemptor gencium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (1. Hymnus) AH 50 Nr. 8 (Str. 2  ff.); (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iste ympnus qui canitur de aduentu domini diuiditur  in quatuor partes. In prima parte in uoce prophetarum inuocat Christum ..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .; (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Conditor alme siderum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (2. Hymnus) AH 51 Nr. 47: (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iste ympnus qui etiam canitur de aduentu domini diuiditur in quatuor partes. In prima parte autor dirigit preces suas ad dominum in generali \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... (Bestand insgesamt: 63 Hymnen, AH-Nummern vgl. Register); (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) AH 50 Nr. 21 (Letzter Hymnus); (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iste ympnus qui in memoriam sanctarum uirginum canitur in cuius materia autor commendat Christum racione uirginitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  autor concludit ymnum suum referendo deo laudes qui est in secula seculorum benedictus. Amen. Finito libro sit laus et gloria Christo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
