\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sancti spiritus assit nobis gracia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < Prolog: [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  apiencia vincit maliciam proposicio scribitur in libro sapiencie etc. In qua duo tanguntur ad ipsius theologie commemoracionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Grates nunc omnes ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (1. Sequenz) AH 53 Nr. 10;(182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iste liber sequenciarum potest diuidi in tot partes quot speciales sequencie in hoc libro ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Natus ante secula ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (2. Sequenz) AH 50 Nr. 15; (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ista sequencia qui eciam in natiuitate domini canitur diuiditur in tres partes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...  (Bestand insgesamt 54 Sequenzen, AH-Nummern vgl. Register); (266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) AH 54 Nr. 218 (Letzte Sequenz); (267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ista sequencia que de beata virgine canitur diuiditur  in tres partes ...\endash ... ad habenda et possidenda sempiterna gaudia ad que nos perducat ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
