\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit defloracio ex tractatu psalmorum sancti Augustini episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Voce mea ad dominum clamaui id est non corporis uoce quae cum strepitu verberati acris promitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... (Enarratio in Ps 3 \u167 \'a7 4, 1); folgende Exzerpte: in Ps 4 \u167 \'a76, 4; in Ps 9 \u167 \'a722, 1; in Ps 14 \u167 \'a73, 1; in Ps 18 enarratio I \u167 \'a713, 1; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) in Ps 18 enarratio I \u167 \'a714, 1; etc. ; (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) in Ps 149 \u167 \'a713, 33; \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Multi elegerunt ignobilitatem et dimittentes domos suas substancias suas distribuentes pauperibus cucurrerunt ad perfectionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (in Ps 149 \u167 \'a714, 39) ...\endash ... (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sic dicunt alleluia corde ore uita. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (in Ps 149 \u167 \'a716,11). \endash  In dieser Zusammenstellung unikale \u220 \'dcberlieferung.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: PL 36, 37, passim. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 M. Grabmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Die Geschichte der scholastischen Methode Bd. 1 Freiburg Br. 1909 S. 183 (Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  Kurz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ,  V, 1,  Appendix II, S. 445, 454 Nr. 33; V, 2  S. 350 (diese Hs.). }

