\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1c\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Homiliae in Canticum canticorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1c\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 169) Expositio allegorica. Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ego ostendam uobis quod facere debeatis. Exo. 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si uolumus aduertere inuenimus clare tria: Primum quod omnes homines bonum humanum uolunt intime et cordialiter ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Capitulum I.: (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Omelia prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Osculetur me osculo oris sui etc. (Ct 1, 1). Librum istum qui secundum Jeronimum doctorem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   egregium in prologo Galeato inter cisicos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!; vgl.  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ller, RB 323;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   entstellt aus: hagiographos ?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   libros deputatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  primus te tergat illa erigat, quod nobis concedat Jhesus Christus etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Folgen 23 Homilien; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Cap. II.: (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tunc sequitur omelia prima 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   capituli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ego flos campi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ct 2, 1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Supra actum est de bono humano huius status intrinseco et sapienciali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   non exclude me ut particeps tui fiam, quod nobis concedat Jhesus Christus amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Folgen 23 Homilien;  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Cap. III.: (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In lectulo meo etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Ct 3, 1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vbi secundum communem distinccionem incipit capitulum et continuatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in fonte suo experiri conceditur. Concede mihi hoc bone Jhesu amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Folgen 20 Homilien; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Cap. IV. 26 Hom.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Cap. V. 28 Hom.; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Cap. VI. 15 Hom.; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Cap. VII. 19 Hom.; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Cap. VIII, 20 Hom., folgt letzte Homilie: (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Fuge, dilecte mi ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ct 8, 14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Circa tercium ergo uidelicet circa montes aromatum duo sunt videnda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ut consors fiat gaudiorum tuorum que sunt in Christo Jhesu domino nostro filio tuo qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Expositio litteralis. Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quoniam multis nimis est placabilis libri cantici canticorum per res gestas inter regem Salomonem et eiusdem reginas exposicio quamuis talis a pluribus reprobetur ... Exposicionem illam ab Orosio aliquando, aliquando autem ab aliis accipiam etc. Explicit prologus, incipit exposicio litteralis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Osculetur me osculo oris etc. (Ct 1, 1). Salomon filius David rex }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in Jerusalem filiam pharaonis regis Egipti propter illius magnam, ut estimatur, pulchritudinem adamauit ut patet I Reg.3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   ca\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  nam delicate  mulieres res satis magnas diminutiue nominant ut appareant delicate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et sequitur tigna domorum nostrarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ct 1,16) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  de hoc dictum est supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Folgen 6 Homilien;  (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Capitulum 8\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 um\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Quis mihi det te fratrem meum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ct 8, 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gracia cuius notandum quod quamquam filia pharaonis simularet se Judeam propter amorem Salomonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  utinam talem ad Salomonem figuratum dominum Jhesum habeamus. Amen. Explicit exposicio litteralis secundum aliquos.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 Vgl. Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB 9937, 9938 (diese Hs.). }

