\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Quaestiones theologicae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tabula questionum huius sequentis libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (nachtr\u228 \'e4glich vorgesetzt) ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  1463\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; \endash  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 An eukaristia dici debeat tantum vnum sacramentum et non plura et videtur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   quod sic ex dictis in glossa super hunc versum et calix meus inebrians quam preclarus est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Ps 22, 5)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quod dicendum sit ad obiecta pro et contra predicta patet per sanctum Thomam parte vltima questione 73 articulo 20.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Aliud dubium {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 an sub vtraque specie sacramenti eukaristie totus Christus contineatur }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et videtur quod non ...\endash ... et ideo in hoc sacramento seorsum consecratur sanguis a corpore non autem alia pars ab alia etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Aliud dubium oritur ex illis {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 an liceat fidelibus sumere corpus Christi sine sanguine}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et uidetur quod non, dicit enim Gelasius papa ut habetur in decretis de consecracione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quia sacerdos in persona omnem sanguinem offert et sumit et sub vtraque specie totus Christus continetur ut patet ex dictis in dubio precedenti. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Folgen 55 Quaestiones;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dubium de immunitate Christi a peccato etc. Contra: Apostolus ad Ro. 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   (12) dicit quod in Adam omnes peccauerunt quia scilicet in eo originaliter sinerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  illum puritatis et sanctitatis gradum ut congrue posset esse mater dei etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  An Christo conueniat iudiciaria potestas secundum quod homo et videtur quod sic per illud Joh. 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (27)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   potestatem dedit ei iudicium facere quia filius hominis est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  iudicabit autem ex uirtute diuinitatis non sine patre et spiritu sancto et apparebit fratribus impiis et inimicis iustis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  An Christus sedeat ad dexteram patris secundum quod deus uel secundum quod homo  pro quo sciendum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vnde non petebant quod sederent ad dexteram uel sinistram sed ad dexteram uel Christi sinistram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Nota vnum paruum dubium super illud Ps. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (21, 2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  deus deus meus respice in me ut quod dereliquisti me \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   se derelictum clamabat non derelinquendum. Et sic est finis.}

