\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ecce dies veniunt dicit dominus et suscitabo  germen iustum et regnabit rex }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Jere. XXIII    \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Venerabiles patres ac egregii domini mei, quantum iuxta mei proni intellectus facultatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  coram reuerendissimis uiris desinere vbi sic concludo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (folgen 14 Verse): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Pie precor pastor nimio si prosequor ausu/ aut loquor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  nam sismate tanto/ stante, reor, mundum nullam sperare salutem.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Collacio facta per me Johannem de Garcz de Veneciis MCCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   XXI. Januarii in vniuersitate Wiennensi ad exhortacionem oracionum fiendarum pro vnione matris ecclesie et prosperitate Innocencii septimi facta infra missam conuentualem etc. etc. etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Vgl. Acta facultatis artium universitatis Vindobonensis 1385\endash 1416, ed.  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 P. Uiblein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Publikationen des Instituts f\u252 \'fcr \u214 \'d6sterreichische Geschichtsforschung VI, 2) Graz, Wien, K\u246 \'f6ln 1968 S. 529.}

