\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit decretum abbreviatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit prologus in librum qui dicitur breuiarium decretorum domini Johannis Kalendrini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (wohl f\u252 \'fcr: Calderini)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Sicut fulgur auri superat fulgorem omnium metallorum ... sic licet profunda sciencia sacre maiestatis domini nostri Roberti Iherusalem et Silicie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (lies: Sicilie) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  regis ... superat scienciam omnium principum ... mihi Laurencio Pulderico clerico Neapolitano inter decretorum doctores minimo ipsius maiestatis consiliario et familiari viua voce mandauit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Distinccio prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Humanum genus. Tractaturus Gracianus de iure canonico}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   legum ecclesiasticarum confusam materiam siue dissonanciam erigere in luculentam concordanciam in hoc opere ...\endash ... solet filius similis esse patri et magistro discipulus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Randanmerkung, 17./18. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Auctor Joannes Kalendrinus vel potius Laurentius Puldericus clericus Neapolitanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  286\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 287\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , GQ II, 250 Anm. 14, 392. }

