\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Repeticio c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [apituli] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Presbyter de cele\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [bratione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  mis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [sarum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Francisci de Zabarellis alias domini Florentini qui in concilio Constanciensi decessit. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Repetiturus decretalem Presbyter (X.3.41.1) que prima sub rubrica de cele[bratione] miss[arum] ponitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vltima bisseno deponitur hora etc. Et est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
