\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De modo obseruandi interdictum memoriale quoddam pro simplicibus colligendo sciendum, quod quando vniuersitas populus uel ciuitas locus uel terra ecclesiastico est supposita interdicto secundum iura que uigent et uiguerunt anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  primo ...\endash ... ne contemptu leui peccatum veniat in mortale.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (299\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 299\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Erg\u228 \'e4nzende Notae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota quod celebrans in loco interdicto efficitur irregularis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  potest quilibet orare priuatim sed non publice. Addicio Jo[hannis] An[dreae] est hec.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  300\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
