\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 An pena potest apponi in permutacionem arguitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et videtur quod pene adiectio inducit simoniam ex eo quod in spiritualibus nullum pactum nullaque adiectio interuenire debet ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (302\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  An propter sanguinis effusionem sit ecclesia execrata maxime inter scolares et est casus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Debita recommendacione premissa venerabilis magister Nicolae post dubiorum vestrorum inspectionem mox rescribere non potui ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Teilweise lateinisch-deutsche Mischprosa.
