\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit exposicio misse reuerendi magistri Heinrici de Hassia alias Langenstein nominatus non diligent ea que secuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Quam breuiter (!) fuerit missa et in ceremoniis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Scriptori pro penna detur pulchra puella que est circa sawis amen. Explicit exposicio misse reuerendi magistri Henrici Langenstein allas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (lies: alias) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  de Hassia nominatus. Scriptus per manus Petri monachi Cladrubensis in monasterio monachorum. Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   tricessimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finitus in die sancti Johannis baptiste etc. Tu autem domine miserere mei et omnibus.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
