\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In Christi nomine incipivnt interrogationes et responsiones Wichrammi cenobiote (!) sancti Galli de compoto Bede prespiteri. Interrogatio:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Quis primvs inuenit menses apud Latinos? Responsio: Romani auctore Romulo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sol zodiacum circulum perlustrat efficerent\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (bricht ab).
