\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad soluendum stomachum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Svme plenam testam oui suci de radice euoli}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et alteram de sambuco suco ex interiori cortice \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   radices que vvlgo heimuurcz dicuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et optime in lecto cooperaris. Statim deo fauente solutionem habebis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Zur althochdeutschen Glosse \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  heimuurcz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schmeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , BWB 1, 1110.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad albuginem vel maculam depellendam vel omnem occvlorum caliginem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Aloe in ereo uase contere et gingiber semotim}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et quacumque uelis hora in oculos deguttaberis. Statim melius habebis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Pulues contra  thisicam passionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Recipe hec: Piretri unciam unam gingiberis et marrubii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et cornus ceruini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et indormitalis hora. Hec omnia simul immixte sunt recipiende.
