\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [D]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ilectissimo mihi in Christo Simoni nepoti meo. Frater Johannes seruus invtilis, solo nomine et habitu religiosus salutem et de bono semper in melius proficere. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Magnam michi leticiam tue dilectionis ingessit eppistulam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... Qui enim se dicit in Christo manere debet sicut et ipse ambulare vnde dicit quidam versificator\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (bricht ab)
