\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [C]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  irca inicium Paruuli philosophie est primo videndum de subiecto etc. ex quo tractatulus presens, cuius noticiam intendimus, introductorius est in philosophiam in libris Aristotilis traditam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (299\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [N]atura est principium et causa mouendi ... Com.: Pro intelleccione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   istius diffinicionis notandum quod natura in diversis passibus philosophie multipliciter causa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (337\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Est tamen sciendum quod aliter deus cognoscit aliter angelus ... deo autem nihil est simplicius etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (337\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Com.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic ponit triplicem modum intelligendi approbatum tribus potenciis intellectiuis ut est primam intelligenciam dei, hominis et angeli ...\endash ... ergo quod ipse sit simplicissimus ultra animalia simplicia qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Zusatz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vtrum anima separata a corpore possit intellegere. Et arguitur quod non quia si sic oportet hec fieri per aliquas sensus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 346\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.}

