\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Consolacio in tribulacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Purissime deuocioni affectum et in aduersitatum procellis spiritu fortitudinis roborari. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Pater et domine colendissime fama peruulgata variis licet et ambiguis referens relacionibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  bellorum strepitus ac fragores litium circa Nurmbergensium confinia grassacione satis barbarica immaniter insolescere ymaginacionem meam die noctuque lacessere non desinit ...\endash ... adiutor in oportunitatibus et summum merencium solamen animorum vestram dignetur paternitatem in hac periculosa rerum vertigine misericorditer consolari. Datum. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer}

