\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes von W\u252 \'fcnschelburg}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   zu Amberg appelliert an Erzbischof Eberhard von Salzburg wegen der Vertreibung aus seinem Amt durch Konrad von Soest. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Appellatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In nomine domini amen. Constitutus honorabilis vir Johannes de Wunschl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (W\u252 \'fcnschelburg) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in artibus magister ...{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Coram te notario publico tamquam persona autentica et testibus hic astantibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   fide dignis ego Johannes etc. ...\endash ... inter posicionem peticionem requisicionem omnibusque. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  Concilium Constantiense 1,7; Edition vgl. u.  S. 163\endash 167;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Bertholdus Puchhauser}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : Sermo in combustione Ulrici Gr\u252 \'fcnsleder, presbyteri Ratisponensis hussitae anno 1420 pronuntiatus. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De presbytero propter heresim combusto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hiis quoque temporibus anno videlicet domini millesimo quadringentesimo vicesimo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   quidam presbyter secularis nomine Vlricus Gr\u252 \'fcnszleder de Vohendresz Ratispone ab adolescencia sua educatus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Noli esse incredulus sed fidelis scribitur originaliter Joh. XXo (27) transsumptiue in euangelio hesterne dominice}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   secundum rubricam curie  Romane. Reuerende pater et domine sancte Ratispone ecclesie, pastor et presul \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  A quibus te et nos preseruet Ihesus Christus qui ... per secula benedictus. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash   Chronica Husitarum 7; Edition vgl. u. S. 350\endash 362. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   197 (diese Hs.);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Bertholdus Puchhauser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : Sermo in condemnatione Henrici Ratgeb de Gotha. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo siue collacio in condempnacione Heinrici de Gotha presbyteri Maguntinensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Noli esse incredulus sed fidelis Joh. XX (27) et in euangelio hesterne dominice. Reuerendi patres et domini cum nemo sciat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   an amore uel odio dignus sit Ecclesiasti IX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   uehementer timeo ...\endash ... quam vitam nobis concedat Christus dei filius.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  Chronica Husitarum 37; Edition vgl. u. S. 392\endash 400. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   198 (diese Hs.);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Richardus Fleming\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : Sermo factus in concilio generali Constantiensi in obitu magistri Wilhelmi Corff. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo in obitu cuiusdam doctoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In Christo reuerendissimi patres et domini invocato primitus mortis atque vite}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   doctoris ...\endash ... per gloriam quam annue nobis domine apud quem est fons vite, trinitas sancta, vera vita, qui viuis regnas et imperas per seculorum secula. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  Concilium Constantiense 5,10; Edition vgl. u. S. 252\endash 256.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
