\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Cusa}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Opera selecta}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De docta ignorantia. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deo amabili reuerendissimo patri domino Juliano sacre apostolice sedis legato dignissimo cardinali preceptori suo metuendo Nicolaus de Cusa. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Admirabitur et recte maximum tuum et iam probatissimum ingenium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   tuum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \endash  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Compleui in Cusa 1440. 12. Februarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (Mit geometrischen Randzeichnungen). \endash  Edition.: Opera omnia I S. 1\endash 164;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Apologia doctae ignorantiae. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit apologia in doctam ignoranciam ad discipulum contra inuectiuam cuiusdam arrogantis nomine Johannis Wenck. Prohemium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Retulit michi aliquando communis preceptor noster}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... Peruenit ad me hodie libellus quidam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finis apologie in doctam ingnoranciam.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  Ebd. II S. 1\endash 36;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De coniecturis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deo amabili reuerendissimo patri domino Juliano  sacre sedis apostolice dignissimo cardinali ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Data nunc qualicumque oportunitate de coniecturis conceptum pandam }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... Quoniam autem in prioribus docte ingorancie libellis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (mit geometrischen Figuren und Schemata). \endash  Ebd. III S. 3\endash 183;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De quaerendo deum.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Desiderio tuo possetenus satisfacturus, frater in Christo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Anno 1445 Moguntie Nicolaus de Cusa.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  Ebd. IV S. 13\endash 35;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De filiatione dei.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Incipit liber eiusdem ad Cunradum de Wartenperg canonicum monasterii Memfeld sacerdotem deuotum de filiacione dei, Nicolaus de Cusa prepositus ibidem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Liber de filiacione dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tandem me compulit studii tui feruencia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash  Finitum anno 1445 die Panthaleonis Julii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Ebd. IV S. 39\endash 64;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De dato patris luminum. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit liber eiusdem ad dominum Gerardum episcopum Coloniensem de dato patris luminum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De dato patris luminum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Etsi iam ante paternitati vestrae nota sit ingenii mei obscuritas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \endash  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <. \endash  Ebd. IV S. 67\endash 87:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Idiota de sapientia. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Incipit dyalogus eiusdem de sapiencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dyalogus primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Conuenit pauper quidam idiota ditissimum oratorem in foro Romano}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finis huius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <. \endash  Ebd. V S. 3\endash 80; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Idiota de mente. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt capitula in dyalogum eiusdem de mente, quomodo philosophus ad idiotam vt proficeret de mentis natura accessit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  > Capitula; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Multis ob iubileum Romam mira deuocione occurrentibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   auditum est ... >In monasterio vallis castri uel caste ordinis Cameldeunsium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   vbi sanctus Romualdus caput ordinis sepultus est prope Fabrianum in Marchia Anthonitana anno domini 1450 die 23. Augusti finiui hunc conceptum de mente N. Cardinalis sancti Petri ad vincula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <. \endash  Ebd. V S. 83\endash 218;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De staticis experimentis. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit dyalogus eiusdem de staticis experimentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Frequentabat consortium idiote orator ille Romanus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Anno domini 1450 die 14. Septembris Fabiani compleui de staticis experimentis N. Cardinalis s. Petri ad vincula. Episcopus Brixiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <. \endash  Ebd. V S. 221\endash 241;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De geometricis transmutationibus. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit liber eiusdem de geometricis transmutationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Paulo magistri Dominici phisico Florentino optimo atque doctissimo viro. N. de. Cusa. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Etsi veteres magno ingenio predicti sedula indagacione conati sunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Talia quidem que in regularibus corporibus fieri possuunt ex his elicito doctrinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mit geometrischen Zeichnungen).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  Druck: Paris 1514 (Nachdruck Frankfurt/M. 1962) II,2 f. XXXIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash XLVIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De circuli quadratura. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Asseris te in varietate scribentium de circuli quadratura }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Admonebam in exordio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec sic tetigisse sufficiat. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In ciuitate Reatina 1450 die 12 Julii N. de C. Cardinalis s. Petri ad vincula compleui hunc tractatum de transmutacionibus geometricis<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash   Opera omnia X/2a. \endash  BAMAT 4 (1994) Nr. 2930 (Hs. genannt); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De mathematicis complementis. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit prologus eius in tractatum de mathematicis complementis ad s. d. n. papam Nicolaum Quintum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tanta est potestas summi tui pontificatus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Nicolae ... Testimonio omni qui se ad geometrica contulerit ...\endash ... in omnium noticiam deducatur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finis complementi mathematice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (Mit geometrischen Zeichnungen). \endash  Ebd. XX (noch nicht erschienen); Paris 1514, II,2 f. LIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De theologicis complementis. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit prologus eiusdem in tractatum de  complementis theologicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Scripseram proxime de mathematicis complementis ad pontificem nostrum Nicolaum quintum ... Visum est autem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   michi non decere opusculum illud promulgari ... Nemo ignorat in ipsis mathematicis veritatem certius attingi quam aliis liberalibus artibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finis tractatus de theologicis complementis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  Opera omnia X,2a S. 3\endash 93. \endash  BAMAT 4 (1994) Nr. 2933 (Hs. genannt);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De pace fidei. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit dyalogus eiusdem de pace et concordia vnice fidei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Fuit ex his qui apud Constantinopolim proxime seuissime acta }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  Ebd. VII S. 3\endash 63;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De visione dei. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt capitula in tractatum eiusdem de visione dei ad venerabilem dominum abbatem et fratres monasterii Tegernsee in quo comprehendit sub compendio omnes modos et genera omnium graduum contemplationum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < Capitula; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit prologus in tractatum de eykona dei cuncta videntis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Pandam nunc vobis dilectissimis fratribus que vobis ante promiseram ... Si vos humaniter ad diuina vehere contendo similitudine}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   quadam hoc fieri oportet ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Primo loco presupponendum esse censeo nihil posse apparere circa visum eikone dei ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et iungar tibi deo absoluto in eternitate vite gloriose. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finis eykone dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finis librorum reverendissimi patris domini Nicolai de Cusa cardinalis s. Petri ad vincula et episcopi Brixinensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <. \endash  Ebd. VI S. 3\endash 90.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 Nicolaus Cusanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 ..., Opera, ed.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18  Faber Stapulensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Paris 1514 (unver\u228 \'e4nderter Nachdruck Frankfurt/M. 1962). \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18  Nicolaus Cusanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Opera omnia iussu et auctoritate Academiae litterarum Heidelbergensis ad codicum fidem edita: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 E. Hoffmann/R. Klibansky\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , I, II, Leipzig 1932. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 J. Koch/C. Bormann/ J. G. Senger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , III, Hamburg 1959. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 P. Wilpert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , IV, Hamburg 1959. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 R. Steiger/L. Baur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , V, Hamburg 1983. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 R. Klibansky/H. Bascour,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18  VII, Hamburg 1959. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 A. D. Riemann/C. Bormann, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 X, 2a, Hamburg 1994. \endash  A. D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 Riemann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , VI, Hamburg 2000; (Hs. erscheint jeweils mit Sigle E). \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs16 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 VL VI, 1095\endash 1113 (H. G. Senger). \endash  BAMAT IV (1994) Nr. 2930, 2933 (Hs. genannt). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 K.-H. Kandler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Nikolaus von Kues, Denker zwischen Mittelalter und Neuzeit, G\u246 \'f6ttingen 1995 (mit. Lit.). }

