\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Vom Pfingstsonntag bis zum 25. Sonntag nach Pfingsten. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Si quis diligit me sermonem meum seruabit Joh. 13o (14, 23). Carissimi quia maliciosi judei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Christo eciam post mortem detrahentes et miracula eius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ysa. LIIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ecce ego creaui fabrum sufflantem in ignem prunas etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 dl/Knoch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , CD, Lucidarius 34; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Emitte spiritum tuum et creabuntur psalmus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (103, 30). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dicit beatus Augustinus: Maxima insania est hominem in miserabili carne confidere et negligere animam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  mendax est et pater eius. Rogemus ergo dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de septem donis spiritus sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Accipietis virtutem superne mentis spiritus sancti in vos Actuum primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (8, variiert). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Carissimi quamuis Christus hec verba discipulis suis dixerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Item Ysaie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (5, 21): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vae vobis qui sapientes estis in oculis vestris. Rogemus ergo dominum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .; ...  Es folgen 53 Predigten, in der Regel zwei pro Sonntag;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica vicesimatercia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (statt: vicesimaquarta) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Loquente Jhesu ad turbas: Ecce princeps vnus accessit M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 t\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   VIIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (20).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Carissimi, dominica proxima docuit Christus rex noster milites suos esse cautos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash ... (210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  aliis autem fama, vide de hoc ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alius sermo de eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Loquente Ihesu ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Mt 9, 20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vbi sciendum quod secundum Augustinum corpus homini fideli valet in quadruplici statu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  incorporat per continuam operacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica vicesimaquinta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum subleuasset oculos in celum Joh. VI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec dominica quia a quibusdam ecclesiis legitur requiratur dominica in media XL\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ma\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   cum postilla sua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  titulus huius dominice reperitur dominica quinta ante aduentum domini et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum subleuasset ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 6, 5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Carissimi, sacra scriptura habet duplicem intellectum scilicet litteralem et misticum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (218a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  non dabunt eis requiem die ac nocte etc. Rogemus ergo dominum etc. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   
