\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de septem peccatis mortalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Arta est via que ducit ad uitam et pauci inveniunt eam M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   VII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (14).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Vbi sciendum quod in die iudicii omne genus humanum in decem diuidetur turbas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ex se dominum offenderat in culpa. Rogemus ergo dominum etc.}

