\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ex concilio Lateranensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Monachi non pretio ...  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Alexander III., 3. Laterankonzil, 1179;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Recolentes qualiter hec sancta plantacio etc. dolentes dicimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   materias in institutionibus conformatas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
