\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Quod dicitur timorem habeas pre occulis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   consorcio quam solacio perfruaris idem abbati et conuentui Sublacense\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!); 
