\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Felix papa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si legittimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  non fuerit accusator non frangetur accusatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Idem episcopus per Galliam constitutus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si quis episcopus ab illis accusatus fuerit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ut condempnentur uel absoluantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Idem Constancie auguste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Omnipotens deus etc. valde graue est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   cum acquiri et disuti debeant honorentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22    
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Pascalis papa: Nulli exponere ab accusacione sua repellere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  a sua communi familiaritate neglexerit separare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Ex concilio Moguntino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De hiis criminibus de quibus absolutus est accusatus ...\endash ... non potest accusacio replicari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Steffanus papa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Repellantur ab accusatione cohabitantes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  solet amicicie incitare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 C. b. liber XLIIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Accusati aliquem et per tuam accusacionem occisus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  debes quadragesimas penitere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Suger super Genesim de monte Abel: Prudencia patrati sceleris non indiget clamore accusacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Qualiter et quando debeat prelatus ab inquirendum et pertinendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et liberius a suis possunt omnifactoribus ammoneri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Idem in eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sicud olim a sanctis patribus noscitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  que correccione uel reformacione sunt digna et ea fideliter perfectant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Ex sinodo Johannis pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De officio ordinarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Pastoralis officii infra ex parte tua fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ut sic post annum recuperare possessionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Idem archiepiscopo Senonensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Licet in corrigendis excessibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   attentissime uigilabit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Idem in eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Quoniam impleris que partibus intra eandem ciuitatem atque dyocesim permixti sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ad tantam insolenciam repellanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Idem in eodem: Inter cetera que ad salutem spectant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  si quis hoc adimplere neglexerit districte  subiaceat ulcioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Honorius episcopo Asisensi: Conquerente  iconio monasterii sancti Benedicti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sicud ab aliis ecclesiis eiusdem dyocesis pro necessitate temporis sustinemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  dem  abbati et conuentui sancti Remigii Remensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ut iusta etc. attendentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  religiosis adiunctis secum uisitationis tempori introducat. Amen.
