\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit ordo qualiter agatur concilium prouinciale. Ordo prime diei ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ordo quarte diei ...\endash ... quibus expletis dum dictum fuerit ab archidiacono: ite in pace, respondet clerus: in nomine domini ... sicque conuentus concilii absoluatur.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Ordo excommunicationis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur Ordo excommunicacionis a Leone papa directus primum accendantur candele deinde sequantur hec maledicciones. Ex auctoritate dei patris omnipotentis ... excommunicamus eos atque maledicimus ...\endash ... reuelabunt celi iniquitatem inde et sic campane sonentur. Et sic cessat prescripta sinodus etc. etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Leonhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (Leonhard III. von Salzburg). Postscriptum: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Maledictum studium per quod negligitur diuinum officium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
