\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Plasmator hominis deus qui cuncta solus ordinat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   ... Idcirco ego Johannes Grumvalder \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Gr\u252 \'fcnwalder)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   decretorum doctor, canonicus et reuerendi patris et domini domini Nicodemis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  episcopi ecclesie Frisingensis in spiritualibus vicarius generalis, visitator et reformator omnium et singulorum monasteriorum virorum quam mulierum sancti Benedicti et sancti Augustini ordinum in Frisingensi docesi constitutorum ... Datum in presenti monasterio N. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [Weihenstephanensi] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  anno domini millesimo quadringentesimo vigesimo sexto die decima mensis Decembris. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
