\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  De modo interrogandi monachos in visitatione secundum Formam visitationis Petri de Rosenheim}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Forma inquisicionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (32 Fragen): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vtrum monachi ipsius monasterii sunt professi regulam et ordinem sancti Benedicti ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Postea uero circa temporalia sic interrogabitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (18 Fragen)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : Item an monasterium est debitum obligatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Item an scit uel credit aliqua alia in ipso monasterio ... quod \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in forma predicti inquisitorii continentur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Fragenkatalog in Anlehnung an die 'Collatio facta in monasterio Weihenstephanensi' des Petrus von Rosenheim, \u252 \'fcberliefert in Clm 21553 aus Weihenstephan, insbesondere an die darin enthaltene 'Forma visitationis' mit einem ausf\u252 \'fchrlichen Interrogatorium (327\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Vgl.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  Deutinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Beylagen S. 267, w. o.  \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 F. Thoma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Petrus von Rosenheim und die Melker Reform, in: StMOSB 45 (1927) S. 212.}

