\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De hys que circa officium diurnum emendanda occurrunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Que circa ieiunia et festiuitates\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;   (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De hys que circa sacramenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Que circa sacerdocium et primo circa presides et prelatos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Que circa electiuas dignitates\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Que circa qualificaciones personarum in gradibus dignitatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Que circa collaciones beneficiorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer. 
