\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De sensu et sensato. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam de anima secundum se determinatum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   est in libro de anima et de virtutibus ipsius nunc de illis agendum est que per se ipsis vitam habentibus et que conuenienter animatis sunt autem talia ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De memoria et reminiscentia. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De memoria et reminiscencia dicendum est postquam dictum est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   quid sit sensus quomodo sentire fiat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De somno et vigilia. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De somno et vigilia determinandum est quid sint et vtrum corpori et anime proprie sint}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De longitudine et brevitate vitae.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  De eo autem quod hec que sint longe vite et alia breuis vite}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De iuventute et senectute. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De iuventute et senectute considerandum est quoniam autem de anima dictum est }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  De respiratione. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De respiracione et exspiracione quedam aliqui priorum philosophorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De vita et morte. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quoniam autem dictum est priusquam viuere et anime habitus  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De motu animalium. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De motibus autem animalium quid est primum mouens animalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De mundo (Interpretatio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Nicolai Siculi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ); (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tria autem necessaria circa cor apparent}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   que videntur eandem naturam habere  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  De generatione animalium. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Est quidem omnibus animalibus generacio et mors}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   sunt autem varii modi et diuersi hec quidem est violencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et pisces in aere moriuntur euidens est ex iam dictis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Stellenweise stark entstellte Texte). \endash  145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
