\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit tabula auctoritatum et sententiarum biblie positarum in libris decretorum et decretalium quotatarum secundum ordinem alphabeti Johannis Calderini decretorum doctoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Seriem huius tabule continentis auctoritates et sententias biblie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... Ego Johannes Calderini minimus decretorum doctor huius opusculi fabricator illos suppleri precor ordine prelibato. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 A. require loqui}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . d. Aaron ...\endash ... Zizania ... Explicit tabula auctoritatum et sentenciarum inductarum in compilacionibus decretorum et decretalium quotatarum Johannis Calderini decretorum doctoris. Deo gracias.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Scriptum in Berchthersgadem ante carnisbriuium sub anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  CCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  LXX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (korrigiert aus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  CCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  LXX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  I\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in vigilia Mathei apostoli. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
