\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (Randnotiz) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus solus orari facit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Vas catholicum ewangelii tuba preco justicie de con[secratione] di [stinctio] I. Agapitus (Decretum III, 1, 23). Cum non oporteat sacris officiis deditos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   vel clericos magos aut incantatores existere ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et qui est pax in celo et gloria in excelsis Luce 19\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (37); (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Venisti ad fontem ingressus es considera quid videris. Reverendissimi domini et patres verba per me proposita solempnissime}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   vestre presencie orienaliter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  fuerunt prolata per beatum Ambrosium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et saluatoris domini nostri Jhesu Christi qui est benedictus in secula ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [E]st aurum et multitudo gemmarum ... (Prv 20,15). Patres et domini venerandi prout descripsit Lotherius tempore quo fuit rector sanctorum Sergii et Lachi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  offeris me ad beneplacita et mandata\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (bricht ab).}

