\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Vos autem sicut homines moriemini. In psalmos LXXXio (7). Inter alia maxime tres defectus humani solent homines prouocare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   ad petendam graciam diuinam ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in futuro coronam eternam quam nobis concedat qui sine fine viuit et regnat etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit collacio facta per dominum Henricum dictum Surdum anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  CCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  XLVIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in die cene et tractat de septem viciis capitalibus et de ramis ab eis descendentibus et de armis contra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <.  (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit alius sermo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (verbessert aus:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   alia collacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   factus per eundem anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  CCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  XLIX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in cena domini tractans de quatuor generibus temporum ab inicio vsque ad finem mundi secundum que tempora quatuor spiritualis ritus peragendi diurnum officium singulis annis commemoramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hec sunt ferie domini sancte quas celebrare debetis Leuiticus XXIII. c. ... (Lv 23,2). Seneca in libro de quatuor virtutibus dicit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : si prudens es  animus tuus tribus temporibus dispensetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vt cognoscant te deum verum et quem misisti Ihesum Christum vt dicitur in ewangelio Johannis XVII capitulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad quam nos perducat qui sine fine viuit et regnat amen.
