\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Notae: De erroribus Graecorum. ... (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exemplum s. Antonii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Desiderium<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    \endash  Speculum morale Lib. I, p. 1, dist. 13; (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De fuga\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  I, 1, 14; (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De dolore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < ... \endash  I, 1, 19\endash 23; (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Zelus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < ... \endash  I, 1, 34; (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De  fide. \endash  I, 3, 14. 19; (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Prudencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  I, 3, 35; (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Disciplina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  I, 3, 42; (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De castitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  I, 3, 95; (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De contemptu mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De miseria<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De Consilio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De passione domini Jhesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  I, 4, 12\endash 19.
