\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones singuli}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De assumptione beate virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Regina Saba ingressa est Jherusalem ... III Reg. X\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (2).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Venerabiles patres et magistri domini doctores eximii ceterique in Christo quam venerabiliter  honorandi: Dum nostre mentis acies erigitur ad considerandum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  postremo recommendo meipsum oracionibus vestris, gracia domini nostri Jhesu Christi sit cum omnibus nobis amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;     
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In die pentecostes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Puluerem pedum vestrorum excutite scribitur Luce IX \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  originaliter et recitatum est in hodierna die ewangelio leccionaliter. Venerabiles patres ... Hac sacra hebdomada ut nostis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  pleni laude et iubilo quod nobis prestare dignetur spiritus almus qui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in secula seculorum amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (Wortreklamanten 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   zeigen den Anschlu\u223 \'df 217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   an) \endash  167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ecce nunc tempus acceptabile, scribitur 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Chorint. VI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  originaliter et habetur etc. Venerabiles ... Quia secundum beatum Augustinum in sermone qui incipit Predicator dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vitam eternam optatam dabit suis ad quam ... Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \endash  folgen 2 Zus\u228 \'e4tze;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Surge vade, scribitur Luce XVII \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (19) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Jone primo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et Numeri 22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (20)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et lectum est in dominice currentis ewangelio ... Venerabiles ... Cum secundum beatum Gregorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  oremus pro inuicem ut saluemur. Gracia domini nostri Jhesu Christi sit cum omnibus nobis amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Videamus hoc verbum, scribitur Luce \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (2, 15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et recitatum est in ewangelio  misse huius excellentissime festiuitatis ... Venerabiles ... Verba preassumpti thematis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  hodie in terris natus mundum perditum reparauit ... in seculorum secula benedictus amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Erit tibi gloria, sic scribitur Luce 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  originaliter et recitatum est in currentis dominice ewangelio ... Venerabiles patres ... Quoniam ut dicit venerabilis Cassiodorus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... (236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  pax omni operanti bonum ad Ro. 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quam gloriam ipse nobis prestare dignetur rex glorie in secula benedictus amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Zusatz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quia secundum Crisostomum pro se orare necessitas cogit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in domu dei ambulent cum consensu etc.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (bricht ab).}

