\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermonum breves dispositiones}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Preparabit viam etc. Ita scribitur Mathei XI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et lecta sunt hec uerba in currentis dominice ewangelio: Uenerabiles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et egregii domini magistri, doctores ... dum in vires collectus animo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  beati Augustini XII de ciuitate dei verba recenseam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in via salutis eterne nos preparet et dirigat qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Thoma appostolo. Ego uox clamantis in deserto ... Jo. 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (23) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et originaliter Ysa. IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (40, 3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In currentis dominice ewangelio in verbis istis appostolus Thomas a duobus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  commendatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et si quid adeo appreciati sunt dupliciter etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In die sancti Steffani sermo. Iherusalem, Iherusalem que occidis prophetas ad te missos quociens volui etc. Pro introduccione nota: Gregorius super Job libro \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  de diabolo per omnia defecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo secundus de sancto Steffano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Volui congregare pullos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   tuos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... (Mt 23, 37). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis propositis doctrinaliter intellectis duo notantur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ideo benedixit thema:  Iherusalem, Iherusalem quociens volui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De circumcisione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Postquam completentur dies octo ut circumcideretur puer ... Luce 2 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Pro introduccione nota: Augustinus super Exodum ...\endash ... opera non in reuersionem facere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De circumcisione domini. Apparuit benignitas et humanitas saluatoris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   misit deus filium suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Gal 4, 4);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In epiphania domini. Vbi est qui natus est rex Iudeorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Math. 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (2).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Pro introduccione nota: Bernhardus in sermone tercio huius festiuitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  hodie nupcias in quibus vinum ex aqua fecit commendauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De eodem sermo secundus. Surge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   illuminare Iherusalem ... Ysa. 60\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In leccione festiuitatis hodierne  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  genimina vipperarum agite fructus dignos penitencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 3, 8);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De conuersione s. Pauli. Circumfulsit eum lux de celo ... Actus 9 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis istis dei gracia in conuersione Pauli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  totaliter non excusatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo secundus de eodem. Circumfulsit eum lux de celo ... Actus 9 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (3).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   In verbis istis apostolus in tribus commendatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  lumine uideri non potest sed per seipsum videtur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De purificacione Marie. Postquam completi sunt dies purgacionis ... Luce 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Pro introduccione uide Ieronimum in translacione Originis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Amen dico vobis nisi etc. magister 3. sententiarum 21. dist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Mathia. Hii sunt qui corde bono et optimo verbum dei audientes ... Luce 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (15) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Pro introduccione scribitur Sap. X\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (10):\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Laudat sapienciam cordis per verbum dei dicens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et scandalum generaret in populo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
