\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Jeronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Proverbia 21505b;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Facile comtempnitur clericus qui sepe vocatus ad prandium non recusat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash ...; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Monachus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sit uilis et uespertinus cibus et olera et legumina interdumque pisciculos pro summis ducas deliciis; Qui Christum desiderat et illo pane vescitur non querit magnopere de cibis preconis quomodo sacerdos conficiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tullius. Perdit auctoritatem cuius sermo opere destruitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash ...; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Rusticus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Nichil est enim impudencius arrogancia rusticorum qui garrulitatem auctoritatem putant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Voluntas dei non est discutienda sed cum graciarum accione percipienda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dies solemnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nobis solicicius prouidendum est ut solemnem diem non tam ciborum habundancia quam spiritus exultacione celebremus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ambrosius: loqui et tacere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Plures in peccatum vidi incidisse loquendo vix quamquam tacendo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash ...; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Verecundia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sicut in senibus grauitas in iuuenibus alacritas ita in adolescentibus verecundia velud quedam vesce commendatur nature\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash ...; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iusticia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sic enim generari iussit dominus omnia ut pastus omnibus communis esset et terra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Largitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Non autem probatur largitas si quid alteri largitur alteri quis extorqueat ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Misericordia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Grandis culpa est si sciente te fidelis egeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash ...; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Liberalitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Est eciam illa probanda liberalitas ut proximos seminis tui non despicias si egere cognoscas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Pecunia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Contemptus pecunie forma est iusticie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Scripturas non intelligere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quidam frater dixit beato Arsenio abbati}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : domine pater, meditari festino de sacris scripturis que didici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  tamen demones effugati discendunt a nobis non sustinentes eloquia spiritus sancti.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Marcharius exemplum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Fuerunt duo Marcharii quorum vnus Egipticus LX annis (!) in desertis impleuit }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Filius vero Marcharius Alexander presbyter fuit. Hic cum audisset \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  his verbis rogatus ab omnibus inde recessit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gaudeamus: Plus est servasse quesitum quam quesisse nouum \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Proverbia 21699 (abgewandelt); 2370; 12465; 7605; 10228; 2816. \endash ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De pecunia. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum pecunie incremento rabies cupiditatis auge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Mens ociosi nichil aliud cogitare nouit quomodo de escis ac ventre et necesse est eum inhonestum esse ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Melius est pauca merita cum securitate acquirere quam ad maiora lucra cum periculo aspirare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Exemplum: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Erat in quadam ciuitate quidam peritissimus tonsor}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   qui denariis ternis unumquemquam detondens necessaria victui cotidie comparabat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sed vix ipsa cottidiani victo necessitatis sustentatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Petronius Bononiensis episcopus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Quid faciunt leges vere pecunia regnat aut paupertas vincere nulla potest iam nunc iudicium nichil est nisi publica merces ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quisquis habet nummos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Proverbia 25565 (6 Verse);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Prosper beati Leonis pape notarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Verbere nonnumquam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  Ebd. 33104a (12 Verse). \endash ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Boecius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Eumodius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sidonius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cassiodorus Theodorici regis Ytalie cancellarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  PL 69, 501 C. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sanctus Machutes transfretando mare illuminescente die pasce Circumspicientes fratres quasi modicam insulam inuenerunt ... Hec Vincentii li\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  22 ca\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   99 in 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   parte historiarum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Vincentius Bellovacensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bibliotheca mundi ... T. 4 Duaci 1624, lib. 21, cap. 98.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gregorius in pastorali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  PL 77, 34C\endash 35B. \endash ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ysidorus: De temptacione carnis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < aus: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Isidorus Hispalensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Synonyma de lamentatione animae peccatricis, zitiert und paraphrasiert \endash  PL 83, 825\endash 868. \endash  245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.}

