\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et in Iherusalem potestas mea ... Ecclesiastici 24 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Sir 24,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Originaliter sic scriptum est in epistula hodierne festiuitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in Iherusalem potestas mea ad quam nos perducere dignetur Jhesus Christus ..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Que est ista que ascendit de deserto ... Cant. 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Bernardus ad propositum in sermone IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   de assumpcione gloriose virginis Marie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  que est ista etc. loco et capitulo preallegat\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (bricht ab);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) [T]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  erribilis est locus iste ... Gn. 28 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Venerabilis Beda super Lucam in quadam omelia in festo dedicacionis ecclesie ad propositum sic loquitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  dicit Bernardus: Confratres mei ymolantes hostiam laudes jungamus verbis sensum ... et humilitate libertatem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (bricht ab).}

