\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt construcciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   de officio sacerdotali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quia sacerdotis officium circa tria principaliter versatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  tales faciant sacerdotes nostris temporibus quales descripti sunt qui cum patre et filio uivant ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Et hic est finis illius 1466 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   feria infra octaua epiphanie per me Vlricum patrem.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Additio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Circa instructionem populi duo sunt necessaria scilicet doctrina et vita ...\endash ... nostris temporibus quales descripti sunt qui cum patre et spiritu sancto viuit ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec addita sunt per venerabilem virum ac dominum Johannem Sawlnhofer de Nappurg magistrum artium ac wacc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [alaureum]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   theologie formatum qui et predicta correxit ex summa s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [ancti] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  T\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [homae] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  de Aquino de officio sacerdotum etc. 
