\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit summa edita a sancto Thoma de Aquino de articulis fidei et ecclesie sacramentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Postulat a me vestra dilectio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... surget corpus spirituale. Ad quam nos perducat pater ... Amen.
