\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 1a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes de Tambaco}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Excerpta ex consolatione theologiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Register. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Registrum questionum Holkot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; (III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Registrum super tractatum magistri Johannis contra communicantes sub vtraque specie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; (V\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )>\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nicolaus de Lira contra iudeos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <;  VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 1a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt excerpta de libro qui intitulatur liber consolacionum theologie quem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  compilauit quidam egregius doctor et magister in theologia dominus Johannes de Thambaco in Alsacia ordinis predicatorum conuentus Argentinensis et scripsit tempore Ludwici imperatoris qui cepit regnare anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  CCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  XV quem excommunicauit Johannes XXII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   papa. Et quia ordo predicatorum tunc temporis pape adheserunt iacturam passi sunt magnam quia expulsi spoliati et fugati de domibus suis. Hec fuit causa compilacionis libri consolacionum theologie.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ex prologo in librum de consolacione theologie sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quoniam secundum apostolum quecumque scripta sunt ad nostram doctrinam scripta sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... (1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tabula rubricarum in genere de sequenti opere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Liber primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ex libro primo qui continet consolaciones super carencia mundane felicitatis ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Primo ergo ut de hiis que opponuntur mundane felicitati non turberis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  erga sui custodiam contra omnes antiqui hostis insidias accingi.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18  15237. \endash  Vgl. BSB-Ink I-524. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 A. Auer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Johannes von Dambach und die Trostb\u252 \'fccher vom 11. bis zum 16. Jh. (Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte der Philosophie und Theologie des Mittelalters 26) M\u252 \'fcnster 1928 S. 16, 191 (Hs. genannt).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \par}

