\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De vigintiquatuor senioribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Honorabili ac prouido viro domino N. plebano Judenburga}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   aut eius vices gerendi decanus et magistri facultatis sacre theologie vniuersitatis studii Wiennensis sincere caritatis affectum in domino Jhesu Christo. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Veridicis nuper relatibus ad nos deducto quod in vestra parrochia Judenburge}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ad cultum demonum pertinens aut aliud illicitum latere. Datum Wyenne in ducali collegio in nostra generali congregacione super hoc sollempniter celebrata. Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   quadringentesimo vicesimo tercio XVII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ma\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   die mensis Octobris sub mei sigilli appensione ad maiorem certitudinem prescriptorum etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
