\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In nomine sancte et indiuidue trinitatis amen. Cum de presentis exilii miseria mortis transitus ... >Prima pars< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cvm omnium terribilium mors corporis sit terribilissima}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ut in pace sit locus et habitacio tua in Jherusalem celesti per eundem Christum.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
