\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   oberer Rand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De ficcione. Sapiencie primo capitulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 1. Quaestio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Questio de ficcione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Sap 1, 5). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 An spiritus sanctus detestetur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et fugiat omnem ficcionem et probatur quod non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   oberer Rand) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Questiones Holkot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 2. Quaestio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Questio super illo verbo: Propter hoc Qui loquitur etc. vsque Et tumultus murmuracionum non abscondetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Sap 1, 8\endash 10)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vtrum peccata per penitenciam condonata sint reuelanda in iudicio generali. Et videtur quod non ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 3. Quaestio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Circa istum textum: Iusticia enim perpetua etc. vsque Ipse ex parte illius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Sap 1, 15\endash 16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dubium est vnde primo proueniat iniusticia in genere humano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 4. Quaestio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dixerunt impii vsque ibi Qui sit reuersus ab inferis etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Sap 2,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Circa istam litteram primo queritur: Vtrum anima humana sit immortalis secundo dato quod sic an possit hoc probari euidenter racione naturali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 57. Quaestio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Fuit tamquam sagitta vsque Sic et nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Sap 5, 12\endash 13).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Dubitacio litteralis vtrum licitum sit meritorum alicui christiano aliquem fidelem sicut paganum inuadendo per vim occidere. Et videtur quod non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 58. Quaestio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Venite ergo fruamur bonis que sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Sap 2, 6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dubitacio litteralis an homo teneatur ex caritate diligere deum plus quam seipsum et arguitur quod sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 59. Quaestio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et transiet uita nostra tamquam vestigium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Sap 2, 3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dubitacio dicta prima de hoc quod dicunt quam nubes siue nebula per calorem solis aggrauatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 60. Quaestio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Opprimamus igitur pauperem iustum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Sap 2, 10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dubitacio litteralis an liceat per potenciam opprimere proximum et videtur quod sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  licet per verberacionem eum ad legem reducere et idem de filio potest pater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
