\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tractatus magistri Johannis Hofman de Swidnicz contra communicantes sub utraque specie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Debemus inuicem diligere scribitur prima Joh. 4 cao (Io 4, 11) originaliter et legitur transsumptiue in currentis dominice officio missali epistulariter: Reuerendi patres ac fratres in Christo dilectissimi ceterique domini preclarissimi , cum in omni presertim quod salutem respicit animarum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Beati qui ibi habitant et diligunt in secula seculorum ad quam vitam ... perducat qui ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et ita terminatur tractatus contra communicantes laicos utraque specie sacramentali editus ab egregio viro magistro Johanne Hoffman de Swidnicz sacre theologie professore pronunciatus in studio Lipczensi anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  XXI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
