\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur in annunciacione beate virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Jesus autem inclinauit se digito scribens in terram Johannes VIII}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  (6). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ista inclinacio Christi significat humilitatem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in honore beate uirginis deuotissime ieiunare etc. rogemus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
