\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo bonus Sabbato ante Letare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Erat vir in Babilone nomine Joachim hic accepit vxorem scilicet Susannam etc. Daniel XIIIo (2). Vbi sciendum quod prophetia ista cum ewangelio hodierno concordat quia vtrobique agitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  si non est amota oracio securus esto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo bonus et edificatorius de corpore Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Venite adoremus et procidamus coram domino qui fecit nos Ps. (94, 6). Karissimi in uerbis istis duo sunt nobis consideranda primo videlicet a (!) peccatis et mundi vanitatibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   strenuissime militauit etc. rogemus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo in vigilia asscensionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!)< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Petitis et non accipitis eo quod male petatis Jacobi IIIIo (3). Ex quibus uerbis sciendum quod si uolumus ut nostre orationes a deo exaudiantur oportet ut bene dispositi et habilitati illas porrigamus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  tu exaudies eos in celo et. rogemus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo in diebus rogacionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Exaudi domine placare domine et fac supplere nobiscum misericordiam tuam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Daniel IX}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  (19). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Vbi sciendum quod in verbis premissis Daniel propheta tria petiuit }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quam bonis operibus iugiter insistere etc. rogemus ergo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo in vigilia asscensionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!)< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Petite et accipietis querite et invenietis pulsate et aperietur uobis Luce XI}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 o}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (9. 10). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Vbi sciendum quod Lucas ewangelista in verbis premissis nos ad tria hortatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   tu ligas omnipotentem etc. deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;}

