\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Passio et opera Christi post Lazari a mortuis resuscitacionem et collocuciones quas dominus habuit cum matre sua scilicet feria 2. 3. 4. etc. secundum Jacobum de Viatrico \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   doctorem in theologia episcopum et cardinalem qui composuit ea propter audiencium deuocionem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Extendit manum et arripuit gladium vt ymmolaret filium suum Gen. XXII}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  ca}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  (10).}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Conswetum est in principio aliorum sermonum inuocare uirginem gloriosam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et gaudia perdita nobis reemeret glorificemus ergo eum qui est in secula seculorum benedictus amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Repertorium III S. 210 (Hs. genannt). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 K. Ruh\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Der Passionstraktat des H.v. St. G., Diss. Z\u252 \'fcrich 1940 S. CV. }

