\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exhortacio quando placet ad populum pro pace serenitate uel alia quacumque tribulacione aut necessitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Si in preceptis meis ambulaueritis ... Leuiticus XVII (26, 3 etc.). In quibus verbis nobis duo consideranda sunt: primo videlicet temporalium bonorum prima promissio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exhortacio pro pace aut altera necessitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnia que fecisti nobis domine in uero iudicio fecisti ... Daniel IIIo (31). Karissimi quamuis in multis deum cottidie offendamus et ad iracundiam prouocemus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...;}

