\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De variis. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur sermo de natiuitate virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Signum magnum apparuit in celo mulier amicta sole {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Apok. XII}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  (1). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Vbi dicit Bernhardus: Quociens nobis sacra eloquia talia verba proferunt in quibus exterior significacio vera esse non potest ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (233}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 va}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  recreamus. Vnde in verbis propositis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancto Georgio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Labora sicut bonus miles Ihesu Christi Thymo. (II Tim 2, 3). Vbi sciendum quod tria notantur quae verum et legittimum (!) faciunt militem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Orate pro inuicem ut saluemini ... Jacobi Vo (16). Vbi sciendum quod beatus Jacobus in verbis premissis duo facit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : Primo namque quod adorandi pro inuicem nos inducit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  transferamur ad celi palacia, quod nobis prestare dignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \u220 \'dcberlieferung einer l\u228 \'e4ngeren Version: Clm 14216, 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur sermo bonus et utilis in commemoracione animarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Memor esto iudicii mei sic enim erit et tuum mihi heri et tibi hodie Eccli. 38o (23). In quibus verbis sapiens ille doctor ecclesie Jhesus filius Sydrach docet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et admonet nos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (243\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur sermo de sancto spiritu predicandus etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Emitte spiritum tuum et creabuntur Ps. (103, 30). Sciendum autem quod ex verbis premissis duo nobis sunt consideranda: Primo quid ad hoc necessarium sit ut spiritus sanctus nobis mittatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; (246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De purificacione virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[17].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Venit in spiritu in templum Luce 5to (2, 27). Vbi sciendum quod verba ista quantum ad litteram dicantur de quodam sancto viro cui nomen Symeon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...}

