\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur ammonicio quam de mandato reuerendi in Christo patris domini Alberti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [III.]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   episcopi Ratisponensis venerabilis vir dominus Bernherus Aufliger canonicus Ratisponensis vicario eius in spiritualibus generalis et in persona eiusdem domini episcopi in sancta synodo Ratisponensi publice pronuncciauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Fratres et sacerdotes domini cooperatores ordinis nostri estis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Nos quidem quamuis indigni locum Aaron tenemus vos autem locum Eleasari ... \endash ... quantum humana patitur infirmitas bonis studeatis operibus adimplere. Prestante domino nostro ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 F. Janner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Geschichte der Bisch\u246 \'f6fe von Regensburg III, Regensburg u. a. 1886, S. 381 ff. (\u220 \'dcbersetzung ins Deutsche). \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  K. Hausberger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Geschichte des Bistums Regensburg\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Regensburg 1989 S. 206.}

