\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Casus iuris in quibus quis pro ipso facto excommunicatus }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  est seu sentenciam excommunicacionis incurrit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Casus tocius iuris in quibus quis est ipso facto excommunicatus sunt isti et primo uidendum est de istis qui tangunt deum et fidem katholicam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [folgen 20 casus]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Secuntur alii casus excommunicacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < ...  (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alii casus excommunicacionis late a iure qui concernunt papam et Romanam ecclesiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...< \endash  61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer; [Fortsetzung folgt] 
