\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) 38.\endash  40. casus ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quadragesimus est inductus contra illos quos ad dirigendas moniales ... ut in capitulo Indempnationibus de eleccione Libro sexto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.}

