\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De modo eleccionis prelatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Prelato cuiuscumque ecclesie, kathedralis uel conuentualis viam vniuerse carnis ingresso}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... Ipso die eleccionis prouideat prior cum cantore quatenus hore canonice debito modo ... percelebrentur ...\endash ... sic uere deus mundos et castos eligit et ipsos in statu felicitatis collocat et reponit. Quod nobis prestare dignetur elector electorum ... Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit sermo de eleccione prelatorum vna cum aliis ad eleccionem pertinentibus editus a uenerabili in Christo patre domino Heinrico Gulpey \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  abbate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (1429\endash 1435)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   sancti Egidii Nurenberge decretorum doctore eximio. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Zusatz von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  cuius anima requiescat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer bis auf Federproben.
