\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Origenes excerpta super cantica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Osculetur me osculo oris sui (Ct 1, 1). Notandum Canticum Canticorum canendum est in progressu uirtutum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Fuge dilecte mi ... et de ipsa sponsa virgine et matre sponsi inteligi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!). \endash  60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  Accessus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In principio librorum tria requiruntur : Auctor materia et intencio auctoris. Nomen, vtrum ethnicus an fidelis katholicus an hereticus fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Commentarius:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Osculetur me osculo oris sui (Ct 1, 1). Quasi dicat: Qui tocies me salutauit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   ipse veniat et me salutet et proprio ore mihi uoluntatem aperiat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Que est ista que ascendit per desertum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Ct 3,6)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... virgula fumi ex aromatibus id est ex odore mirre thuris et v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [niversi]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   pulueris pigmentarii id est ex omnibus speciebus medicinalibus\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (bricht ab) \endash  Stark gek\u252 \'fcrzte Bearbeitung der Expositio in Ct des Honorius Augustodunensis. \endash  PL 172, 347C\endash 402D.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [O]sculetur me osculo oris sui (Ct 1, 1) ... Ad intellectum istius verbi Cantica Canticorum nuncupatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : Quantum sensum litteralem est sciendum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... neque cernere salutem crebra consulacione me visitare meto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  etc.  Expliciunt cantica Canticorum cum sensu litterali et cetera. Deo gracias. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.}

