\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De processu iudiciario et primo de iudicio illiusque diffinicione ac qualitatibus iudicii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iudicium est actus trium personarum scilicet iudicis, rei et actoris secundum Hostiensis summam de iudicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Sed in secundo casu fit contra ius in fauorem publicum statum cui partes renuncciare non possunt et oc \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (hoc) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sicuti no\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [ta]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in c. si de re iudi li. VI. et in ipsa Cle. per Panor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [mitanum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  etc. Libellus extractus ex diuersis compendiis et summarie compilatus per Arnoldum Fabri.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  Als Quellen werden haupts\u228 \'e4chlich Liber Sextus, Constitutiones Clementinae, Extravagantes und Digesta zitiert, seltener {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Tudeschis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Panormitanus) oder {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus de Segusia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Hostiensis).}

