\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Yhsus Maria. Queritur primo quid sint hore canonice et quare clericus obligetur ad ipsas horas canonicas dicendas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... (Verzeichnis von 40 Quaestionen) (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Materiam horarum quas canonicas appellamus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   sub breui stilo diuina opitulante gracia tractandum assumpsi ego Albertus de Ferrariis de Placencia iuris vtriusque doctor quamuis indignus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  intra in gaudium domini tui ad quod quidem gaudium ille nos perducat qui est trinus et vnus semper benedictus in secula seculorum amen. Conradus Sybenhar scripsit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
