\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit tractatulus reprobationis erroris de viginti 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   senioribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Venerabili ac  prouido   et sollicito viro domino N. in superiori Stiria archidiacono decanus et magister sacre theologie vniuersitatis studii Wiennensis ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Orthodoxe fidei puritas professionis nostre fidelitas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  aut aliud illicitum latere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Datum Wienne in ducali collegio generali congregacione super hoc solempniter celebratum anno domini 1421 decima septima die mensis Octobris sub nostri sigilli appensione ad maiorem certitudinem prescriptorum.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Schreibersubskription:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Rescripta est hec epistula per me Vlricum de 24 senioribus per quam veritas de huius 24 senibus declarent scripta. Anno 65\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
