\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Matthaeus de Aula regia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo in die sancti Bernhardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Laudauit dominus villicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Luce 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in presentis ebdomade ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ebd. 256 (9); Zuschreibung am unteren Rand (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Istum sermonem fecit dominus doctor Matheus in Aula regia. Professus eiusdem monasterii.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 K. Lauterer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  VL VI, 170 f.f. \endash  Ders. in: Cistercienser Chronik 71 (1964) S. 107;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  )  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Johannes Hus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : Sermo ad clerum in synodo Pragensi. (Randeintrag) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo Johannis Husz heretici condempnati in concilio Constanciensi cuius memoria in malediccione sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   ebd. 258 (30); (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit sermo ad clerum factus in sinodo Pragensi magistri Johannis de Hussenecz sacre theologie baccalarij sed postea idem Ribaldus factus fuit heresiarcha et in sacro Constanciensi concilio condempnatus et degradatus et combustus iuxta suam perfidiam cuius memoria in malediccione sit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Petrus de Stupna.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Sermo in synodo Pragensi. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit sermo factus in synodo Prage a reuerendo magistro Petro de Stupna nec non baccalario sacre theologie.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   ebd. 258 (31); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Sermones de sancto Bernhardo. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   ebd. 258 f. (32\endash 37); ebd. VIII, 444 (2\endash 5). \endash 211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.}

