\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis (15. Jh.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Contenta huius libri. Sermones latini reuerendi patris in Christo domini Henrici de Wildenstein episcopi et Comitis Tergestini per eum compilati et in diuersis locis presentati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \endash  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) In cena domini. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [A]ccipite et manducate hoc est corpus meum, prima Cor. XI (24). Congregati estis domini mei et patres reverendi vt ait venerabilis Hugo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in sermone de spiritu sancto ad audiendum verbum dei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  par non habet seculum quod efficiat corpus meum, quam etc. Amen. Sermo Heinrici de Wildensteyn episcopi Croacensis de cena domini Jhesu. Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  CCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   70 in Praga coram caesare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) In cena domini. [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  n finem dilexit eos Jo. 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in ewangelio presentis diei recitato. Congregati estis domini mei et patres reverendi vt ait venerabilis Hugo in sermone de spiritu sancto ad audiendum verbum dei vobis incumbit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  qui nos pauit et lauit hac die cui est honor et imperium per infinita secula seculorum amen ... feria tertia ante translacionem beati Wenceslay ducis Boemie anno domini etc. LXXVI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in Luthomisl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  III. sermo de eodem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [H]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  odie est rex et cras morietur Ecc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   X \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Sir 10, 12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Pro spiritus sancti impetranda gratia interpello thronum diuine clemencie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  mortis pro victoria cui honor gloria manet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in secula seculorum amen. Sermo domini Henrici episcopi Croacensis de cena et passione Christi editus anno etc. LXXVI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in Luthomisl. Incipit IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   eiusdem de cena Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Lauit pedes eorum Jo. 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Pro spiritus sancti impetranda gracia interpello cum beato Ambrosio lib. II\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   de apologia Dauid c\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   14 qui ait: Cor mundum crea in me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vnde Ambrosius super Beati immaculati littera III\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   ait quis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (bricht ab). \endash  19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  hesus assumptus est a vobis Actus 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in epistula hodierna. Beatissime pater et domini mei prestantissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   prout ait beatus Augustinus libro de IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   virtutibus desiderium caritatis uestre exigit a nobis debitum desiderium sermonis officium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et tenebit me dextera tua hoc nobis prestare dignetur qui ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo domini Heinrici de Wilden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [stein]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   episcopi Tergestini factus Rome in ecclesia sancti Petri coram domino papa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  anno etc. 71\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Accipite et manducate hoc est corpus meum originale M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 t\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   26\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (26)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et prima ad Corinth. XI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (24) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in epistula festi hodierni. Reuerende pater et domini, congregati estis vt ait uenerabilis Hugo in sermone de spiritu sancto ad audiendum verbum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  siue per vitam siue per mortem michi enim viuere Christus est quod nobis concedat ipse dominus noster Jhesus Christus qui ... in secula seculorum amen. Reverendus pater in Christo dominus Heinricus de Wilden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [stein]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   dei gratia episcopus et comes Tergestinus ad laudem dei omnipotentis in die sancti Benedicti hunc sermonem compegit in Wienna anno domini etc. LXXXVII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Predigtnotizen; (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  CCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  LXXXVII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Wienna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Apparuit gracia dei saluatoris nostri ad Tytum 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in epistula hodierna. Pro sancti spiritus impetranda gracia reposco cum propheta: Cor mundum crea in me \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vnde ad Tytum 2 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sobrie iuste et pie etc. saluatoris nostri Ihesu Christi quod nobis concedat Ihesus Christus etc. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De sancto Luca. [C]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  onfirmabit vos usque in finem sine crimine p\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   ad Corinth. p\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in dominice currentis officio. Reuerendi domini mei et patres carissimi, luculenter apparet quod inquinatus labio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  hoc nobis largiri dignetur rex angelorum per merita sancti Luce qui regnat et imperat per infinita secula seculorum amen. Sermo Heinrici de Wilden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [stein]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   episcopi Croacensis factus in Auinione anno etc. LXXI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De sancto Nicolao. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ecce sacerdos magnus qui in diebus suis placuit domino Ecc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   L c\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in epistula hodierna. Reverendi patres, quod spiritus sancti impetranda gracia dico confidenter cum beato Augustino \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  : Quantum ad me pertinet omnibus locutus sum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in bonitate et alacritate anime sue placuit domino quod nobis concedat Jhesus Christus etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si peccauit in te frater tuus vade et corripe eum M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 t\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in ewangelio hodierno. Reuerendi patres et domini, prout ait beatus Ambrosius libro II\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   de apologia Dauid  c\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   XIIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : Cor mundum crea in me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quam vitam post occidua plangibilis exilii nos tribuat rediuiua gracia Christi qui regnat ... per infinita secula seculorum amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tu es qui uenturus es M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 t\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   XI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in ewangelio hodierno. Reuerendi patres et domini mei, congregati estis ut ait uenerabilis Hugo in sermone de spiritu sancto ad audiendum verbum dei: Vobis incumbit audire \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   cuius regnum et imperium sine fine permanet in secula seculorum amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Randeintrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo domini Heinrici episcopi Tergestini tunc vero Croacensis super finem domini Karoli imperatoris semper augusti et regis Boemie gloriosi. Preciosa fuit anima mea in oculis tuis primo Regum 26\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (I Sm 26, 21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Confidens de clemencia illius qui est scienciarum dominus dans verbum ewangelizantibus veritate multa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quia clemens et pius fuit clemencia sibi preparabit vitam Prouerbia XI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (19) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quod anime concedat qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Mortuus est senex plenus dierum Job ultimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (42). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Reuerendi patres et domini si scripturarum abdita velimus perlustrare patebit euidenter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  non lugent uel eciam de ipsis rident. D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [e] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  istis inquam prophetauit Ysaias d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [icens]\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (bricht ab). \endash  67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 Druck: Die beiden letzten Predigten bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 H. Bansa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Heinrich von Wildenstein und seine Leichenpredigten auf Kaiser Karl IV., in: DA 24 (1968) S. 203\endash 223 (nach dieser Hs.). \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 dl/Knoch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , CD, Henricus de Wildenstein 1\endash 12 (nach dieser Hs.). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18  A. Linsenmayer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Geschichte der Predigt in Deutschland von Karl d. Gro\u223 \'dfen bis zum Ausgange des vierzehnten Jahrhunderts, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1886, S. 466 (Hs. genannt). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 K. Eubel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Hierarchia catholica medii aevi Vol. I, Regensburg 1898 S. 503.}

