\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de BMV}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de assumpcione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quasi cedrus exaltata sum in Lybano Ecc. XXIIII (Sir 24, 17). Vbi sciendum quod ad declaracionem mire virtutis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ibi omnia que querimus inuenimus et perpetue possidebimus ... in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quasi cedrus ... (Sir 24, 17).  In quibus verbis notare debemus exaltacionem beate virginis Marie}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   In omni gente et in omni populo primatum terni \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Sir 24, 10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  etc. Rogemus ergo dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de purificacione virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Postquam completi sunt dies purgacionis ... Luce IIo (22). Vbi sciendum quod beata virgo Maria hodie tria fecit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sic erit et resurreccio mortuorum. Rogemus ergo dominum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo valde bonus de concepcione virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Consurget virga de Israhel. Numeri XXIIIIo (17). In quibus verbis intemerata adhuc in futuro concipienda prenunciata est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  cuius glorie participes nos efficiat qui sine fine viuit et regnat. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   }

