\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Bertholdus Teuto I}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Horologium sapientiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit prologus in horelogium sapiencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam secundum Gregorium omnis Christi accio est nostra informacio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hinc est quod olim ad preces deuoti militis cuius nomen summo deo notum est de vita Christi et eius passione et morte dolorosa vnum libellum thewtunica lingwa composui quem horelogium deuocionis appellaui. Sed ut magis literatus sapiat in latinum transtuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (verk\u252 \'fcrzter Prolog ohne Nennung des Autors)  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit horelogium deuocionis quod est interpretatum quasi horas legens deuotas etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < Schema: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Propria voluntas hec mala facit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \endash  62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 Druck des deutschen Textes: GW 4168\endash 4170 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs18 Zeitgl\u246 \'f6cklein des Lebens und Leidens Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 ), des lateinischen Textes: GW 4172\endash 4176 u. \u246 \'f6. \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs18  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 Vgl.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18  BSB- Ink B-392\endash 400. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18  Kaeppeli \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18  671 (Hs. genannt).  \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 P. K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 nzle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Heinrich Seuses horologium sapientiae (Spicilegium Friburgense 23), Freiburg/Schweiz 1977 S. 65  f.}

