\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De passione domini sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Recordare paupertatis et transgressionis mee ... Trenorum IIIo (Lam 3, 19) Vbi sciendum quod Jeremias in verbis premissis tangit tria}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  passionis Christi frequens memoria. Rogemus ergo dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de passione domini Jhesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Respice in me quia vnicus et pauper sum ego (Ps 24, 16). Ex quibus verbis sciendum quod hodie debemus respicere in Christum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   pendentem in cruce ...\endash ... et fluent aque scilicet lacrimarum. Rogemus ergo dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Notabile quod in inferno nulla est redempcio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Mortuo homine impio non erit vltra spes scilicet liberacionis. Proverbiorum XI. (7). Nota quod VIII sunt cause quare latro captos (!) et incarceratus sperat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   liberacionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in eternum non exhibit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de septem sacramentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Misit dominus verbum suum et sanauit eos. Psalmista (Ps 106, 20). Vbi sciendum quod verba premissa possunt dupliciter exponi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  dum crescunt dona crescunt et raciones donorum. Rogemus ergo dominum amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancta Margaretha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Postquam vidit draco quod proiectus esset in terram persecutos (!) est mulierem etc. Apokk. XII (13). Karissimi, per istam mulierem possumus intelligere beatam Margaretham}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... sepeliuit eas in domo Sincletice matrone religiose. Rogemus ergo dominum etc. \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium IX S. 114 Nr. 87;
