\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Lib. I (Prolog): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Noticiam grammatice saltem aliquantulam attingere cupientibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ego Chun/radus de Muro cantor et pro tempore rector/ \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  puerorum in ecclesia Thuricensis prepo /siture\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  me paucos versiculos/ alienis ex ortulis furtim sublatos/\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in presenti libello positurum. Incepto an/ no ab incarnacione domini M CC XLIIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  / XV\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   kalendas Aprilis indiccionis secunde; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Text): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnis conficitur oracio partibus octo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  / Nomen cum casu communitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit primus liber Nouigrecismi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Lib. II. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Liber secundus Nouigrecismi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit secundus liber Nouigrecismi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  <; (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Lib. III. ; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Lib. IV. \endash ... (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Summe quorundam bene si numerum meministi. Explicit Nouus grecismus anno domini M CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   XXXV\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in die Mathei apostoli et ewangeliste.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Comm.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Item tot sunt uersus huius libri: 10554.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Register: (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec uocabula continentur in primo et secundo libris Nouigreciste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec uocabula sequencia continentur in tercio et quarto libris Noui greciste. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  183a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 183d\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer bis auf (183a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Notiz. 
