\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    Naturkundliche und Sachglossare. (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De nominibus auium in generali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Auis vogel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  avicedula snepfe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De nominibus ad piscaturam pertinentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Piscator fischer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  tongrus grosz al vel Gongrus;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Animal tyr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vnicornis einhorn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De nominibus equorum et ad equos pertinentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Equus  pfert \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  preharalis sperlach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De nominibus tam serpentum quam reptilium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Accalabrus howschreck\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vermiculus w\u252 \'fcrmlein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De nominibus arborum et fructuum eorum et primo in generali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Arbor pawm \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  pomillo h\u246 \'f6ckner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Secundo in speciali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Abies etc. tanne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  pixis p\u252 \'fcchs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De nominibus herbarum<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Apoteca apoteck\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  zizilees silermoten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung vgl.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  Grubm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Ex quo S. 318 (Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt). (210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Apocrifarius id est summus legatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  zamentum samet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Abstractum geformt gefreiet geemluczt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!)...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Zorobael scilicet iste magister Babilonie est contractum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ex integris tribus nominibus et hoc hebraicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Allgemeine Glossare. (214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Nomina: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Abba hebraice vater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  zodiacus est circulus in celo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Verba: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Abreuiare k\u252 \'fcrczen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  zymnare kammeren machen etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et sic est finis anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   XXX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in vigilia Calixti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; Anh\u228 \'e4nge; (267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Vers: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Initia 6301.
