\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Liber I: (Anfang unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quelibet priuacio siue defectus ad esse et cognicionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sunt autem secundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [aeqivocationem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  etc. Posita diuisione fallaciarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...  (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  appellat hic laborantem infirmum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \endash ... (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et sic opponens non posset habere conclusionem. Explicit super primum librum elencorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Liber II: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De responsione autem et quomodo oportet etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hic incipit secundus liber elencorum in quo docet Aristotiles soluere oraciones sophisticas ...}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quod enim est maximum potestate minimum magnitudine difficilimum est ad inueniendum. Explicit ammen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   benedicta sit beata trinitas atque indiuisa unitas.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 Teilweise (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs16 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 \endash 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs16 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 ) ediert: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 St. Ebbesen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 , Texts on equivocation 1130\endash 1270, in: Cahiers de l'Institut du moyen \u226 \'e2ge grec et latin 67, Universit\u233 \'e9 de Copenhague, K\u248 \'f8benhavn 1997 S. 142\endash 151 (nach dieser Hs.).}

