\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alius prologus magistri Alberti Remensis vel magistri Leonis Parisiensis secundum quosdam. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnis scriptura divinitus inspirata Paulo apostolo dicente}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ut interfectio Golye significat interfectionem dyaboli a Christo. Hiis itaque dictis ad sequentia transeamus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22     
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (unterer Rand) Notiz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iste raciones sunt fratris Jacobini de Barbarano concesse fratri Amatori Fauentino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
