\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Bartholomaeus de Gozadoriis de Mantua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Insignia doctoratus. Esset vrbanum nec inficior conscripti patres honestum sermonem ...\endash ... cui benedicere proprium est. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   II, 5971; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Oracio per rectorem vniuersitatis eleccionem facienda. Quoniam vellem, patres et doctores amplissimi, ut judicium quod hodierno die de me fecistis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quod a nobis acceperim atque ampliorem restituam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 5350, 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Christophorus Barzizza\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Oracio Christofori Barzizii per ipsum habita in assignacione Capucii rectoratus egregio arcium doctori Latinuo Taruisino Kl. Junii 1432 in templo cathedrali Patauii. Nisi apud vos dignissime pontifex magnifici pretores ac ceteri viri clarissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  virorum expectacioni satisfaciendum arbitraberis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Jacobus da Zochis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Jacobus da Zochis in principio repeticionis pro scolare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Quoniam quam, celeberrimi patres, ... hoc tam graue et inconsuetum onus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ad principale propositum condescendo etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alia oratio. R\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [everendissimi]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [cellentissimi] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  patres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iam conceperam omnem timorem a me excutere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ad principale propositum videlicet ad rubricam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Bertalot \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  II, 9074;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alia similis. Reuerendissimi p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [atres] ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sacratissimorum canonum, morum atque virtutum fontes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  his igitur breuissimis contentus preambulis ad principale propositum condescendam etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alia oratio siue arenga principii receptionum. Si a nostris maioribus qui eiusdem generis certamina subierunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  nomine replicato virginis gloriose ad principale accedo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alia arenga repeticionis siue thema. Non sum nescius p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [atres] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  amplissimi quantum honoris hodierna die susceperim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  cum suis notabilibus etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash 218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Arenga uolentis baccalariaris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   in presencia rectoris. Celeberrime rector ... Iam in alto mentis mee conceperam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quod nemo ponere potest ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   II, 9127;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Oracio fienda per illum qui uult legere loco alterius. Rem nouam et incognitam mihi nunc satis aggrediar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  venio ad rubricam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Imitaciones primo ad potestatem et capitaneum. Magnifici et graciosi presides, etsi vestris corporis dominacionibus verbum proponendo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in morales sapiencie vestre gracias habebunt etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Spectabilis ac generose vir ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   ad vestra obsequia artius adstrictos esse fatemur etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Honorabilis ac magnifice virtutis vir \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  peramplius arcius adstricti.}

